v> <div class=\"message\">Is drinking the mortal's bloo required? I thought them drinking vitae at the point of death and the vampire choosing to sire was all that was required.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They have to be drained of blood. You could do it through other methods. And there are some bloodlines or protovampires that work off of different ways, either naturally or through a special ability. A posthumous embrace can happen from someone who's fed on Vitae before death, but it's not guaranteed to work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T15:20:03-07:00","id":681446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/645929-cure?p=681301#post681301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They have to be drained of blood. You could do it through other methods. And there are some bloodlines or protovampires that work off of different ways, either naturally or through a special ability. A posthumous embrace can happen from someone who's fed on Vitae before death, but it's not guaranteed to work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is the posthumous embrance going to create a Hollow or is that a Mekhet only thing?<br />","signature":"","edite